    "en": {
      "trackName": "Word Trace - Word Puzzle Games",
      "description": "Word Trace is a calm, beautiful word game. Trace letters into words, fill the scape, and wander through fifty luminous places — lavender fields, forest dawns, northern lights.\n\nA GENTLE PUZZLE TAKES YOU ON A LONG JOURNEY\n• 500 curated levels across 50 scenic chapters\n• Trace with one finger — no typing, no countdowns\n• Hints, shuffles and a bonus-word meter when you are stuck\n• Chain finds without a miss to multiply each word's score\n\nSOMETHING NEW EVERY DAY\n• Today's Puzzle — a fresh daily scape, with streaks and streak freezes\n• Weekly Scape — one puzzle, all players, every week\n• Daily challenges that pay out coins\n\nCOLLECT ALL CHAPTERS\n• Every chapter has its own scenery, light and mood\n• The Field Journal lets you revisit every chapter you've solved\n• Earn stars, coins, Game Center leaderboards and achievements\n\nMADE THE QUIET WAY\n• Free to play: the first five levels are ad-free, then occasional interstitial ads between levels\n• One small one-time purchase removes ads forever on iPhone and iPad\n• No account, no subscription\n• Progress syncs privately through iCloud\n\nALSO ON APPLE WATCH\nWord Trace was born on Apple Watch, and the watch edition is still its own little game — with its own puzzles, its own pace, and the same Game Center leaderboards.",
      "releaseNotes": "Word Trace 2.0\n\n• 500 curated levels across 50 scenic chapters\n• Today's Puzzle with streaks, and a Weekly Scape shared by everyone\n• Field Journal: collect every chapter you clear\n• Daily challenges, coins, hints and shuffles\n• Combo scoring — consecutive finds multiply each word's points\n• Game Center leaderboards and achievements\n• iCloud sync across iPhone and iPad\n• Free with occasional ads; a one-time purchase removes them",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/word-trace-word-puzzle-games/id6761848534?uo=4",
